SUMMARY:Fall 2026 Org. Leadership Training
DESCRIPTION:Annual training for student organization leaders with the Off
 ice for Community\, Inclusion and Engagement and the Events Office to dis
 cuss student organization activities\, policies and procedures.  Training
  is mandatory for student organization presidents and treasurers. Any com
 munications or programming/social chairs are also highly encouraged to at
 tend.  Lunch will be provided\, likely pizza. Please RSVP below by 5:00 p
 .m. on August 24.&#160\;
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Annual training for student organizatio
 n leaders with the Office for Community\, Inclusion and Engagement and th
 e Events Office to discuss student organization activities\, policies and
  procedures.</p><p>  Training is mandatory for student organization presi
 dents and treasurers. Any communications or programming/social chairs are
  also highly encouraged to attend.</p><p>  Lunch will be provided\, likel
 y pizza. Please RSVP below by 5:00 p.m. on August 24.&#160\;</p>
